{# BJJ Transition Hub Page Template #}
{# Generates hub pages with summaries from attacker and defender perspectives #}
{# Input: Root fields (name, description, overview, etc.) + attacker, defender, outcomes #}

---
title: "{{ name }} | BJJ Technique | BJJ Graph"
description: "{{ description }}"
---

{# PostHog A/B Testing Metadata #}
<body data-content-type="transitions-hub">

{# Flexbox wrapper for A/B testing #}
<main class="content-wrapper" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">

<section id="overview" class="content-section">

{{ overview }}

**From Position**: [[{{ from_position.split('/')[0] }}]] ({{ from_position.split('/')[1] if '/' in from_position else '' }})
**Success Rate**: {{ success_rate }}%

</section>

<section id="possible-outcomes" class="content-section">

## Possible Outcomes

| Result | Position | Probability |
|--------|----------|-------------|
{% for outcome in outcomes -%}
| {{ outcome.result | capitalize }} | [[{{ outcome.to.split('/')[0] if '/' in outcome.to else outcome.to }}]] | {{ outcome.probability }}% |
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section class="content-section">

## Attacker vs Defender

| &nbsp; | Attacker | Defender |
|--------|----------|----------|
| **Focus** | Execute technique | Prevent or counter |
| **Key Principles** | {{ attacker.key_principles[0][:60] }}... | {{ defender.key_principles[0][:60] }}... |
| **Options** | {{ attacker.execution_steps | length }} execution steps | {{ defender.defensive_options | length }} defensive options |

</section>

<section id="attacker-summary" class="content-section">

## Playing as Attacker

[[{{ name }}/Attacker|→ Full Attacker Guide]]

### Key Principles

{% for principle in attacker.key_principles %}
- {{ principle }}
{% endfor %}

### Execution Steps

{% for step in attacker.execution_steps %}
- **{{ step.action }}**: {{ step.description[:100] }}...
{% endfor %}

### Common Mistakes

{% for error in attacker.common_errors[:3] %}
- **{{ error.error }}**
  - Consequence: {{ error.consequence }}
  - Correction: {{ error.correction }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="defender-summary" class="content-section">

## Playing as Defender

[[{{ name }}/Defender|→ Full Defender Guide]]

### Key Principles

{% for principle in defender.key_principles %}
- {{ principle }}
{% endfor %}

### Recognition Cues

{% for cue in defender.recognition_cues %}
- {{ cue }}
{% endfor %}

### Defensive Options

{% for option in defender.defensive_options[:3] %}
- **{{ option.action }}** - When: {{ option.when_to_use }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

{% if variants_and_adaptations is defined and variants_and_adaptations %}
<section id="variants" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Variations

{% for variant in variants_and_adaptations %}
**{{ variant.variant_name }}**: {{ variant.description }}{% if variant.when_to_use %} (When to use: {{ variant.when_to_use }}){% endif %}

{% endfor %}

</section>
{% endif %}

{% if position_integration is defined and position_integration %}
<section id="position-integration" class="content-section">

## Position Integration

{{ position_integration }}

</section>
{% endif %}

<section id="related-content" class="content-section">

## Related Techniques

{% for item in related_content %}
- [[{{ item.name }}]] - {{ item.relationship }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

</main>
